   "issue": "`coeff_add_mul_of_X_pow_dvd` parses as `coeff n ((f + g) * h)`: `coeff_add` is the established Mathlib name for the coefficient of a sum (`Polynomial.coeff_add`, Mathlib/Algebra/Polynomial/Coeff.lean:41; `HahnSeries.coeff_add`, Mathlib/RingTheory/HahnSeries/Addition.lean:115), while here `add` is meant to encode the shifted index `n + k`. Mathlib's own shifted-index lemmas leave the index arithmetic out of the name (`PowerSeries.coeff_X_pow_mul : coeff (d + n) (X ^ n * p) = coeff d p`, Mathlib/RingTheory/PowerSeries/Basic.lean:384).",
